  {
    "description": "Save a project as FCPXML 1.10 (Final Cut Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Premiere through it) and OpenTimelineIO (.otio: Resolve, Premiere, Avid through OTIO's adapters), so a person can finish the cut in an editor. Carries the clips with their source times and transitions, inserts on video tracks above, texts as titles (markers in OTIO) and sounds on audio tracks; returns what an editor can't take this way (effects, framing, generated music). Saves beside the project as <name>.fcpxml and <name>.otio, or in \`out\`, a folder, and never overwrites.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "format": {
          "description": "Which to save (default both)",
